[{"id":"addon:spencer_s_last_breath:torn_bookmark","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-04","title":"书签碎片","titleEn":"Torn Bookmark","rarity":"ultra","description":["很久以前用于夹在圣书中的一片洁白而质朴的缎带。曾是纷争的象征。","·闪现可用次数增加1。","·闪现恢复时间增加30%。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_tornBookmark.webp","glyph":2,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Torn_Bookmark","pinyin":"shuqiansuipian","initials":"sqsp"},{"id":"addon:spencer_s_last_breath:matchbox","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-04","title":"火柴盒","titleEn":"Matchbox","rarity":"ultra","description":["一个火柴盒，里面装着一套并不匹配的奇怪纽扣。像是个可怕之地的印记。","·将闪现最多可用次数设置为 1次。","·护士的基础移动速度增加至4.4米/秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_matchbox.webp","glyph":2,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Matchbox","pinyin":"huochaihe","initials":"hch"},{"id":"addon:spencer_s_last_breath:bad_man_s_last_breath","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-04","title":"“恶男”的濒死之息","titleEn":"\"Bad Man's\" Last Breath","rarity":"very-rare","description":["从克洛普瑞恩疯人院的病人“恶男”那里抢走的濒死之息。它在护士的双手中剧烈地炸开了。","·闪现攻击命中逃生者会使护士获得无法侦测状态，持续25秒。每45秒可触发一次。","无法侦测状态会隐藏杀手的气场、恐惧范围与红光。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_badMansLastBreath.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/%22Bad_Man%27s%22_Last_Breath","pinyin":"enandebinsizhixi","initials":"endbszx"},{"id":"addon:spencer_s_last_breath:kavanagh_s_last_breath","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-04","title":"卡瓦纳的濒死之息","titleEn":"Kavanagh's Last Breath","rarity":"very-rare","description":["从克洛普瑞恩疯人院的清洁工哈佛里·卡瓦纳那里偷来的濒死之息。这强烈的气息在护士的手中剧烈地颤动。","· 疲惫状态下，护士附近8米内的逃生者会受到障目状态影响60秒。","障目状态会使逃生者无法看到气场。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_kavanaghsLastBreath.webp","glyph":1,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Kavanagh%27s_Last_Breath","pinyin":"kawanadebinsizhixi","initials":"kwndbszx"},{"id":"addon:spencer_s_last_breath:campbell_s_last_breath","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-04","title":"坎贝尔神父的濒死之息","titleEn":"Campbell's Last Breath","rarity":"very-rare","description":["从克洛普瑞恩疯人院的牧师坎贝尔神父那里抢走的濒死之息。它在护士的手中发出强烈的噼啪声。","· 完整蓄力闪现后再出现时，护士可以立刻向当前面对的方向以完整蓄力再次闪现。","· 仅限于护士还有剩余闪现次数的情况。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_campbellsLastBreath.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Campbell%27s_Last_Breath","pinyin":"kanbeiershenfudebinsizhixi","initials":"kbesfdbszx"},{"id":"addon:spencer_s_last_breath:jenner_s_last_breath","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-04","title":"珍娜的濒死之息","titleEn":"Jenner's Last Breath","rarity":"very-rare","description":["从克洛普瑞恩疯人院的病人玛丽·珍娜那里抢走的濒死之息。这股气息在护士的手中剧烈的颤抖。","·闪现全部使用完后，护士可以按主动能力键立刻闪现回之前的位置。","·必须在护士疲惫前使用。","·回到之前的位置后，护士完成闪现蓄能。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_jennersLastBreath.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Jenner%27s_Last_Breath","pinyin":"zhennadebinsizhixi","initials":"zndbszx"},{"id":"addon:spencer_s_last_breath:fragile_wheeze","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-04","title":"微弱的叹息","titleEn":"Fragile Wheeze","rarity":"rare","description":["从坎贝尔神父那里偷来的慌乱而虚弱的气息。在护士的抚摸下悄无声息地扭曲着。","·闪现攻击造成重伤状态，持续70秒。","重伤状态会使治疗所需时间增加25%，该效果会持续一段时间，或直至被完全治疗。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_fragileWheeze.webp","glyph":1,"confidence":0.98,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Fragile_Wheeze","pinyin":"weiruodetanxi","initials":"wrdtx"},{"id":"addon:spencer_s_last_breath:anxious_gasp","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-04","title":"急促的喘息","titleEn":"Anxious Gasp","rarity":"rare","description":["从一个焦虑的女孩那收集来的惊恐的喘息，护士对其情有独钟。这喘息在护士的手中拼命颤抖着。","· 闪现穿过逃生者将使其尖叫，并获得200血点作为惊吓奖励。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_anxiousGasp.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":0.98,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Anxious_Gasp","pinyin":"jicudechuanxi","initials":"jcdcx"},{"id":"addon:spencer_s_last_breath:heavy_panting","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-04","title":"沉重喘息","titleEn":"Heavy Panting","rarity":"rare","description":["从清洁工那里偷来的舒缓而鼓胀的气息。微弱地在护士的手中颤抖。","·一次以上闪现后的突进持续时间延长10%。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_heavyPanting.webp","glyph":7,