":"fghnz"},{"id":"addon:spencer_s_last_breath:white_nit_comb","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-04","title":"白梳子","titleEn":"White Nit Comb","rarity":"common","description":["在诊所找到的头虱梳子。曾象征着一位紧张症病人与她的护士之间亲密的关系。","·闪现攻击突进距离减少50%。","·闪现攻击得分事件获得血点增加100%。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_whiteNitComb.webp","glyph":1,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/White_Nit_Comb","pinyin":"baishuzi","initials":"bsz"},{"id":"addon:spencer_s_last_breath:metal_spoon","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-04","title":"铁勺","titleEn":"Metal Spoon","rarity":"common","description":["光泽黯淡又布满锈斑的金属勺子。没收自202病房的病人“恶男”。","· 闪现攻击命中逃生者会使其痛苦呻吟增加50%，持续60秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_metalSpoon.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Metal_Spoon","pinyin":"tieshao","initials":"ts"}]
